{"id":"syncopation-53","name":"Syncopation-53","type":"Pulse Rifle","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8fba4bb117d4a60d493cfad491ec2358.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/2856514843.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed","s":{"943549884":10,"2715839340":30}},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed","s":{"155624089":10,"943549884":-5,"2715839340":10}},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed","s":{"155624089":5,"943549884":5,"1240592695":5}},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil","s":{"943549884":-10,"1240592695":10,"2715839340":10}},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability","s":{"155624089":5,"943549884":15}},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed","s":{"155624089":-10,"943549884":-5,"1240592695":15}},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range","s":{"1240592695":10}},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability","s":{"155624089":10}},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability","s":{"155624089":7,"1240592695":7}},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed","s":{"943549884":-15,"1240592695":10}}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness","s":{"2714457168":10,"3871231066":30,"4188031367":-20}},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size","s":{"3871231066":20}},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"1240592695":5}},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"1240592695":5}},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"155624089":10,"1240592695":5}},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed","s":{"155624089":5,"4188031367":15}},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"1240592695":5,"4188031367":10}},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range","s":{"1240592695":10}},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size","s":{"155624089":5,"3871231066":10,"4188031367":10}},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size.","s":{"4188031367":30}},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness","s":{"155624089":15,"1240592695":-5,"2714457168":7}}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Hip-Fire Grip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b481f0ed53a3ae0b31a370d115a06860.png","desc":"Increases accuracy, stability, and precision hit targeting when firing from the hip."},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Compulsive Reloader","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ef5843dfe8134c7385945216ece2bb06.png","desc":"Grants increased reload speed when close to full magazine."},{"name":"Steady Hands","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ed60dd27f28737cbfc77bf41c3784c01.png","desc":"Kills provide improved handling for all weapons for a short duration."},{"name":"Zen Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Outlaw","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/382df469a091c33e190ee583b64923e8.png","desc":"Precision kills greatly decrease reload time."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Headstone","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3a705de0f526aea681a5ffd99b400ab8.png","desc":"Precision final blows spawn a [Stasis] Stasis crystal at the victim's location."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Headseeker","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bdca577f8850f3c6168e9bc055019934.png","desc":"Body shots landed with this weapon increase precision damage and aim assist for a short time. Body shots landed while the perk is active refresh the time."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Focused Fury","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/15fb47018719c99ae37d10f794bc957e.png","desc":"Dealing a portion of the magazine as precision damage grants this weapon bonus damage. The shot count is reset whenever the weapon is reloaded or stowed."}]}],"notes":["pandapaxxy (PvE / M+KB / Controller): \"Syncopation is in an interesting spot right now. It competes with Eyasluna, the previous best headstone weapon while also being able to make crystals, but from further ranges. Being a pulse rifle puts it in a better spot for range and having multiple bullets per burst rivals hand cannon’s big single shot damage. The unfortunate part is no rapid hit to maximize the weapons feel, but it does have some incredible utility with stasis builds and general crystal shattering.\" Recommended MW - Reload.","pandapaxxy (PvP / M+KB): \"If one pulse screamed consistency this pulse would do it. PvP falls into one of two categories. Consistency or lethality. Syncopation doesn’t have anything to push it into the 2 burst realm outside of person buffs (empowering rift, inertia override, etc) but it does have utter consistency. Arrowhead cleans up the recoil perfectly, while high-caliber rounds makes it harder to get hit in return. Then the choice between moving target, the newly buffed hip-fire grip in combination with headseeker or rangefinder.\" Recommended MW - Range.","pandapaxxy (PvP / Controller): \"If one pulse screamed consistency this pulse would do it. PvP falls into one of two categories. Consistency or lethality. Syncopation doesn’t have anything to push it into the 2 burst realm outside of person buffs (empowering rift, inertia override, etc) but it does have utter consistency. Arrowhead cleans up the recoil perfectly, while high-caliber rounds makes it harder to get hit in return. Then the choice between moving target, the newly buffed hip-fire grip in combination with headseeker or rangefinder.\" Recommended MW - Stability.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 13. PvE first-choice roll for stasis builds. Shapeable. Solid feeling weapon - could do with a tiny bit of help with recoil direction in the barrel, and then your choice of mag perk for stability, range, reload speed or combat effect. Maybe more PvP options with the traits, but Outlaw and Headstone provide a solid choice of weapon for stasis builds. Recommended MW: Handling or Reload Speed, with Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Minor, Major, or Taken Spec) mod.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 13. PvE backup roll for stasis builds. Shapeable. Solid feeling weapon - your choice of barrel and mag. Maybe more PvP options with the traits, but Outlaw and Headstone provide a solid choice of weapon for stasis builds. Recommended MW: Handling or Reload Speed, with Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Minor, Major, or Taken Spec) mod.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 13. PvE first-choice roll for end-game use. Shapeable. Solid feeling weapon - could do with a tiny bit of help with recoil direction in the barrel, and then your choice of mag perk for stability, range, reload speed or combat effect. Maybe more PvP options with the traits, but Outlaw will help keep kill streaks going once you proc Frenzy. Recommended MW: Handling or Reload Speed, with Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Major, Boss or Taken Spec) mod.","[YeezyGT's WQ] [MW: Any] \"Syncopation feels somewhat standard as a 390RPM, with a decent suite of perks. There's some interesting PvP capabilities here with Enhanced Hip-Fire Grip, though for PvE, I'd say it works as you'd expect, with very few surprises.\" tags:pve","Chevy's S16 Super Pog PvE Loot List. Recommended MW - Range"],"craftable":true,"sources":["Open Legendary engrams and earn faction rank-up packages."],"activities":[],"hash":2856514